Note: This project downloads IP geolocation data from P3TERX/GeoLite.mmdb.
That data is derived from MaxMind's GeoLite2 database, © MaxMind, Inc., and is
subject to the GeoLite2 End User License Agreement and CC BY-SA 4.0. AllowCN
does not redistribute the database; it is fetched at runtime on your server.
